&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Druva&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Druva is the resilience foundation for the AI enterprise, helping organizations secure and recover from connected risk across data, cyber, identity, and AI. The Resilience Cloud is a fully managed, cloud-native SaaS platform that delivers air-gapped and immutable protection across cloud, SaaS, on-premises, endpoint, and edge environments. Powered by Dru MetaGraph, Druva’s graph-powered intelligence layer, the platform connects critical business context so customers can understand risk, respond faster, recover cleanly, and govern data with greater confidence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trusted by nearly 7,500 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 500, Druva helps safeguard the critical information and systems businesses depend on in an increasingly connected world.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.druva.com/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;druva.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/druvainc&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DruvaInc/&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic and versatile Sr. NetSuite Administrator to join our growing team. This role is pivotal in ensuring the smooth operation of the business and supporting the company&#39;s overall growth. The ideal candidate will possess a strong blend of technical expertise, problem-solving skills, and a proactive approach to system management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, support and maintain NetSuite system configurations, including customizations and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage integrations into and from NetSuite from tools like Celigo, Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with key finance stakeholders and collaborate with cross-functional teams to optimize NetSuite for business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and manage customizations for NetSuite modules to meet business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain custom fields, records, and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage user roles, permissions, provisioning, access controls and data security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with data import and exports, ensuring data integrity and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend solutions for systems improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain custom reports, suitelets and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing support to users, troubleshooting issues and answering questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide user training for user roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date on NetSuite features, enhancements and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage NetSuite business process improvements, projects and ensure delivery of projects outlined in the NetSuite roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years experience as NetSuite administrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current NetSuite Certified Administrator qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional understanding of NetSuite core functionalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in implementing and configuring NetSuite modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in creating custom fields, records, and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical experience with modern API methods, SQL and the development of complex systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NetSuite Suitescript is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
