&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.druva.com/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;druva.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/druvainc&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DruvaInc/&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled SDET to join our Agile development team. In this role, you will not just test software; you will deconstruct complex features to understand their design, build robust automation frameworks, and ensure the resilience of our cloud-based backup solutions.&lt;br&gt;You will work closely with developers to perform white-box and black-box testing, owning the quality of features from conception to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
