&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with bug and test management tools (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Jira, XRay&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Agile testing methodologies and quality metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, troubleshooting, and debugging capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version Control:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;SVN&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
