&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with virtualization technologies (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;VMware&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NoSQL databases (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;MongoDB, Cassandra&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with the development team in an Agile environment to understand functional specifications and design requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Independently create comprehensive feature test plans aligned with development milestones and feature completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage existing automation frameworks to automate feature tests and actively augment libraries to support new functionalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the complete test execution cycle for user stories, ensuring high-quality delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform a mix of automated, manual, white-box, and black-box testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Create, maintain, and document testbed setups and environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Timely reporting, tracking, and updating of issues and test cases using management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure quality benchmarks are met throughout the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Tech / B.E / M.E./ M.Tech (Computer Science) or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience : 6-9 Years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Druva&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Druva is the resilience foundation for the AI enterprise, helping organizations secure and recover from connected risk across data, cyber, identity, and AI. The Resilience Cloud is a fully managed, cloud-native SaaS platform that delivers air-gapped and immutable protection across cloud, SaaS, on-premises, endpoint, and edge environments. Powered by Dru MetaGraph, Druva’s graph-powered intelligence layer, the platform connects critical business context so customers can understand risk, respond faster, recover cleanly, and govern data with greater confidence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trusted by nearly 7,500 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 500, Druva helps safeguard the critical information and systems businesses depend on in an increasingly connected world.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.druva.com/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;druva.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/druvainc&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DruvaInc/&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team &amp;amp; Mission: Druva Product Platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Druva Product Platform&lt;/strong&gt; team builds the shared core SaaS application foundation that every Druva product is built on. Our multi-tenant services, APIs, and control-plane capabilities manage tenant provisioning and lifecycle, Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM/RBAC), distributed job scheduling, usage metering, and platform observability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because every Druva workload depends on this platform, quality and reliability are critical. A bug or latency spike in the platform propagates across the entire Druva ecosystem. Quality Engineering in this team is a pure software engineering discipline: we build scalable automation frameworks, and implement CI/CD quality gates that safeguard billions of operations each year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (QA / SDET)&lt;/strong&gt; on the Druva Product Platform team, you will be the technical lead for quality engineering across distributed multi-tenant microservices, high-throughput APIs, and asynchronous event streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build test strategies, test automation frameworks in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;, design functional test suites including scale &amp;amp; chaos engineering, partner with developers from day one (Shift-Left), and embed automated quality gates into CI/CD deployment pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills (Must-Haves)&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5–8+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of progressive experience in software quality engineering / SDET, with a focus on backend distributed systems and multi-tenant SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding skills in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Go (Golang)&lt;/strong&gt; with a deep understanding of data structures, OOP principles, and test automation design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in developing &lt;strong&gt;test automation frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; from scratch (using frameworks like PyTest, Testify, RestAssured, Playwright, or Selenium).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced expertise in &lt;strong&gt;RESTful API and gRPC testing&lt;/strong&gt;, including API contract validation, schema backward compatibility, and mock services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;AWS Cloud services&lt;/strong&gt; (EC2, S3, RDS, DynamoDB, Lambda, EKS) and containerization (&lt;strong&gt;Docker, Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL for data validation, state verification, and synthetic test data generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience integrating automated test suites into &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; (GitHub Actions, Jenkins) with sub-15 minute execution loops and zero tolerance for flaky tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills (Nice-to-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Chaos Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; methodologies and tooling (Chaos Mesh, AWS FIS, LitmusChaos) to validate system fault tolerance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in data protection, backup/recovery, storage systems, virtualization, or cyber resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise SaaS security testing (OWASP Top 10, auth flows, mTLS, RBAC testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing event-driven architectures and streaming pipelines (Apache Kafka, AWS SQS/SNS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing Generative AI / LLM workflows and evaluating AI model outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Infrastructure as Code (Terraform) for provisioning ephemeral test environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain modular, scalable test automation frameworks in Python or Go for microservices, REST/gRPC APIs, and distributed event pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate comprehensive end-to-end test strategies and test plans for multi-tenant control plane capabilities, IAM, job orchestration, and metering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &quot;Shift-Left&quot; quality by actively reviewing architectural RFCs and PRs, defining testability requirements, edge cases, and acceptance criteria upfront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, automate, and execute large-scale concurrency, and stress test suites to uncover bottlenecks before production releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement Chaos Engineering experiments simulating node failures, network latency, and service degradation to validate system resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed automated regression, API, and integration suites into CI/CD pipelines, providing fast and reliable feedback gates to developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze production incidents, reproduce edge-case defects, and build permanent automated regression tests to prevent bug leakage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and improve Quality Engineering metrics: Defect Escape Rate, Automation Coverage (&amp;gt;90%), and Flaky Test Ratios (&amp;lt;1%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior QA engineers and developers in automation framework architecture, clean testing patterns, and quality best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Tech / B.E / M.E / M.Tech in Computer Science, Information Technology, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
